                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>screenCustomPricebook</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Custom Pricebook</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Add products to a Quote. Invoked from the highlights panel quick action. Shows a searchable checkbox list of products in the Quote&apos;s pricebook. Sales filter by name, tick what they need, click Add to Quote - all products added in one action with qty 1 and NRC charges paired immediately. Flow closes automatically and the page refreshes.</description>
